## Remaining gates

- Implement/test nearest-rank calibration, prepare the report, and measure rated
  source coverage, structured-output coverage, and candidate counts before
  production enforcement. Keep manual ranges for a week before considering
  automatic recalibration.
- Validate band chat routing and full-ID `call_logs.combo_name` in a safe live
  request. Check production catalog/usage ID matches and aggregate-read cost;
  confirm candidate pools are non-empty and
  `OMNIROUTE_AUTO_FREE_FALLBACK_TO_FULL_POOL` is unset.
- Before production reserve enforcement, inspect shared daily metadata shape,
  measure refresh/read cost, and compare proposed exclusions with observed
  quota exhaustion using approved read-only validation. Keep disabled reserve
  as a full stop.
- Complete the unmodified Node 24 build/start smoke at
  `23a11484862b3bb589a55e85b00e4ac53ffeb234` on a supported isolated host. An
  earlier build's `--rm` container metadata and exact exit cause are gone. The
  diagnostic retry did not run because free disk was 17.67 GiB, below the
  24 GiB minimum; available memory was 10.14 GiB. No disk cleanup or retry was
  performed. OpenSpec task 1.4 remains unchecked.
- SystemOne live gates remain: confirm OpenRouter request/response shape;
  test Laya-only RU/UK, Laya stop/fallback, and 413/422 recovery followed by a
  small request; collect 50-request direct/proxy latency; verify allowed-model
  policy and production flag-off; monitor deployment variables, rollback, and
  error rows. Laya deployment and the Hermes caller switch are outside this
  repository.
- Resolve the deployment reference `/opt/apps/omniroute/source` in
  `/Users/theDay/.ssh/config.md`; only timestamped backups were found. Keep the
  migration collision repaired only in the isolated rehearsal copy; permanent
  migration compatibility code is forbidden.
- Correct the upstream `QuotaSnapshotRow` declaration/getter contract in a
  separate slice. The runtime getter returns camelCase fields and numeric
  `isExhausted` (`0 | 1`); the reserve code currently uses a strict local
  camelCase boundary without a compatibility shim.
- After the remaining implementation and operational gates pass, archive the
  four OpenSpec packages. Do not archive or deploy based only on local tests.
